<title>UK: UK notes in circulation rise 6.5 pct in week.</title>
<headline>UK notes in circulation rise 6.5 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British bank notes in circulation rose 6.5 percent in the week of Dec 4 over the equivalent week a year ago, data released by the Bank of England showed. Last week the annual rise was 6.8 percent.</p>
<p>NOTES IN CIRCULATION (in rounded bln stg) -</p>
<p>				Latest week  pvs week	yr-ago week</p>
<p> Notes in circulation     21.39	  21.07	   20.08</p>
<p> Bankers' deposits	   1.99	  1.95	     1.82</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
